From: GitHub Copilot <noreply@example.com>
Date: Sun, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] docs(env): add .env.example for local and remote DB config

Add example environment file for local and Neon/Supabase PostgreSQL configuration.

---
 .env.example | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)
 new file mode 100644

diff --git a/.env.example b/.env.example
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e69de29
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.env.example
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Variables de entorno para el backend PostgreSQL
+# Usa DATABASE_URL para Neon o Supabase cuando tengas una DB remota.
+# Ejemplo: DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/aerolinea
+DATABASE_URL=
+PG_CONNECTION_STRING=
+
+DB_USER=postgres
+DB_PASSWORD=tu_contraseña
+DB_HOST=localhost
+DB_PORT=5432
+DB_NAME=aerolinea
+DB_SSL=false
+DB_SSL_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=false
+
+# Opcional para Vite
+BROWSER=chrome
